[{"text":"FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[source, target, {p1, p2, ...}] finds loop momentum shifts that bring loop integrals or topologies in the list source to the form specified in target. The integrals/topologies in intFrom and intTo are assumed to be equivalent and their denominators must be properly ordered via FCLoopToPakForm. Here the loop momenta p1, p2, ... belong to the source topologies.","anchor":"fcloopfindmomentumshifts"},{"text":"target must be provided as a list of FeynAmpDenominator objects, while intFrom is a list of such lists.","anchor":"fcloopfindmomentumshifts"},{"text":"It is also possible to invoke the function as FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[{FCTopology[...], FCTopology[...]}, FCTopology[...]].","anchor":"fcloopfindmomentumshifts"},{"text":"For topologies involving kinematic constraints some mappings may require shifts not only in the loop but also in the external momenta. Such shifts are disabled by default but can be activated by setting the option Momentum to All. This option can be dangerous, because the amplitude does not necessarily have to be symmetric under shifts of external momenta!","anchor":"fcloopfindmomentumshifts"},{"text":"Normally, FCLoopFindMomentumShifts will abort the evaluation if it fails to find any suitable shifts. Setting the option Abort to False will force the function to merely return an empty list in such situations.","anchor":"fcloopfindmomentumshifts"},{"text":"Overview, FCLoopToPakForm, FCLoopPakOrder.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"source = {{FAD[p4], FAD[p1], FAD[p1 - p3 - p4], FAD[{p1 - p4, m1}], FAD[{p3, m1}], FAD[p3 + q1], FAD[p1 + q1]}}","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left( \\begin{array}{ccccccc} \\frac{1}{\\text{p4}^2} & \\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2} & \\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-\\text{p3}-\\text{p4})^2} & \\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-\\text{p4})^2-\\text{m1}^2} & \\frac{1}{\\text{p3}^2-\\text{m1}^2} & \\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}+\\text{q1})^2} & \\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}+\\text{q1})^2} \\\\ \\end{array} \\right)\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"target = {FAD[p4], FAD[p1 + p4 + q1], FAD[p1 - p3 + q1], FAD[{p1 + q1, m1}], FAD[{p3, m1}], FAD[p3 + q1], FAD[p1 + p4 + 2 q1]}","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p4}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}+\\text{p4}+\\text{q1})^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-\\text{p3}+\\text{q1})^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}+\\text{q1})^2-\\text{m1}^2},\\frac{1}{\\text{p3}^2-\\text{m1}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}+\\text{q1})^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}+\\text{p4}+2 \\;\\text{q1})^2}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[source, target, {p1, p3, p4}]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\{\\text{p1}\\to \\;\\text{p1}+\\text{p4}+\\text{q1}\\}\\}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[{{FAD[r4], FAD[r1], FAD[r1 - p3 - r4], FAD[{r1 - r4, m1}], FAD[{p3, m1}], FAD[p3 + q1], FAD[r1 + q1]}}, {FAD[p4], FAD[p1 + p4 + q1], FAD[p1 - p3 + q1], FAD[{p1 + q1, m1}], FAD[{p3, m1}], FAD[p3 + q1], FAD[p1 + p4 + 2 q1]}, {p1, p3, p4, r4,r1}]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\{\\text{r4}\\to \\;\\text{p4},\\text{r1}\\to \\;\\text{p1}+\\text{p4}+\\text{q1}\\}\\}\\]","anchor":"cb4-4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"source1 = {FCTopology[ fctopology3, {SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}], FCTopology[ fctopology4, {SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}]}","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{fctopology3},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2},\\text{p3}\\},\\{Q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right),\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{fctopology4},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2},\\text{p3}\\},\\{Q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb5-17","section":"Examples"},{"text":"target1 = FCTopology[ fctopology1, {SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{fctopology1},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2},\\text{p3}\\},\\{Q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb6-8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[source1, target1]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\{\\text{p1}\\to -\\text{p1}-\\text{p3}+Q,\\text{p2}\\to -\\text{p2}-\\text{p3}+Q\\},\\{\\text{p1}\\to Q-\\text{p2},\\text{p2}\\to Q-\\text{p1},\\text{p3}\\to -\\text{p3}\\}\\}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"source2 = {FCTopology[topo1, { SFAD[{{l1 + q1, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l1 - l2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2 + q1, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2 - q2, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {l1, l2}, {q1, q2}, {SPD[q1, q1] -> 0, SPD[q2, q2] -> 0, SPD[q1, q2] -> s/2}, {}]}","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo1},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{((\\text{l1}+\\text{q1})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l1}-\\text{l2})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l2}+\\text{q1})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l2}-\\text{q2})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{l2}^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{l1},\\text{l2}\\},\\{\\text{q1},\\text{q2}\\},\\left\\{\\text{q1}^2\\to 0,\\text{q2}^2\\to 0,\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}\\to \\frac{s}{2}\\right\\},\\{\\}\\right)\\right\\}","anchor":"cb8-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"target2 = FCTopology[topo2, { SFAD[{{l1 - l2, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l1 - q2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2 - q2, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2 + q1, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{l2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {l1, l2}, {q1, q2}, {SPD[q1, q1] -> 0, SPD[q2, q2] -> 0, SPD[q1, q2] -> s/2}, {}]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo2},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{((\\text{l1}-\\text{l2})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l1}-\\text{q2})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l2}-\\text{q2})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{l2}+\\text{q1})^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{l2}^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{l1},\\text{l2}\\},\\{\\text{q1},\\text{q2}\\},\\left\\{\\text{q1}^2\\to 0,\\text{q2}^2\\to 0,\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}\\to \\frac{s}{2}\\right\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb9-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Mapping these two topologies onto each other requires shifts in the external momenta","anchor":"cb9-7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Quiet[FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[source2, target2, Abort -> False]]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCLoopFindMomentumShifts: }\\;\\text{Failed to derive the momentum shifts between topologies topo1 and topo2. This can be due to the presence of nonquadratic propagators or because shifts in external momenta are also necessary.}\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\{\\}\\}\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Once we allow such shifts, everything works as expected","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopFindMomentumShifts[source2, target2, Momentum -> All]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\{\\text{l1}\\to -\\text{l1}+\\text{l2}+\\text{q2},\\text{q1}\\to -\\text{q2},\\text{q2}\\to -\\text{q1}\\}\\}\\]","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"For equivalent topologies containing mixed quadratic-eikonal propagators it’s often not possible to find suitable shifts because the function cannot reconstruct the correct momentum flow through such propagators","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"}]